        <body>
            <div xml:id="d407">

                <pb facs="0727" n="657" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg657"/>

                <head>No. 406.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Frelinghuysen to Mr. Morgan.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1883-06-05"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 5,
                        1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>If agreeable to Mexican Government, will be glad to extend agreement of July 29
                    to term first fixed, or one year from August 18 next. You are authorized to
                    conclude agreement on either basis.</p>
                <closer><signed>FRELINGHUYSEN.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
